## New
* SMS OTP Auto-Submit: Added opt-in support for automatic SMS OTP detection and auto-submit during an OTP challenge flow. The SDK uses the Google SMS User Consent API to request the user's one-time consent to read the incoming SMS, extract the OTP code, and fill in the challenge field automatically. Required setup:
  1. Add the optional runtime dependency to your app's `build.gradle`:
     ```groovy
     implementation "com.google.android.gms:play-services-auth-api-phone:18.0.2"
     ```
  2. Enable the feature when building `ConfigParameters`:
     ```kotlin
     AdyenConfigParameters.Builder(...).smsOtpAutoSubmitEnabled(true).build()
     ```
  On GMS-free devices or when the dependency is absent, the feature is silently skipped.

